{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1e951919-00d1-8b2e-aed0-03459bfc21b7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T17:39:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, but the recording said to use this number for snow stuff. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line stays open for snow and storm questions in the evening. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I just want to know when the snow parking ban lifts. We got that dusting today and it's been freezing all week, so I wasn't sure if the ban was still on or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where would you be parking, which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "169 Dean Avenue. Fifth Ward, off the avenue there, not far from the boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "169 Dean Avenue, got it. And just so I have it right, you're asking when the parking ban comes off for your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, exactly. Whether I can put my car back on the street tonight or if I have to wait till morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at what's posted. [pause] Okay, I'm seeing that with just the light snow today there's no active ban tonight. The ban only goes in when a real storm is declared, and then it's announced. So you're fine to park on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So there's no ban right now at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, nothing in effect right now. If one is called, it lifts when the plows have finished clearing the streets and it's announced, so it'd be a window after the snow stops, not a set hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can you log that I called? Just so there's a note that I asked about Dean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll log it as a parking ban inquiry, 169 Dean Avenue, calling Monday evening. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zelia Lopes. L-O-P-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zelia Lopes, L-O-P-E-S. All logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Sorry, one more thing, it's not city related, but I'm stuck inside with this cold, so I bought a thousand-piece puzzle and about a hundred pieces are missing. Just my luck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, a hundred. That's a lot to be missing. Can you return it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably. I'll see about that tomorrow. Anyway, that's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Stay warm, Zelia. If a ban gets called, it'll be on the city's announcements and the recorded message on this line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. Good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T17:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good night."
    }
  ],
